  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "KatLang lets you write formulas, give them names, and combine them into larger calculations.\n\n- Define a reusable formula in one line. In Speed = distance / time, KatLang infers the implicit parameters distance and time.\n- Calculate with 34 significant decimal digits.\n- Pass formulas to map, filter, and reduce to transform lists and combine their values.\n- Run calculations from .NET with your own operations, resource limits, and cancellation.\n\nRead the short introduction at https://katlang.org/introduction",
